## Why This Is Asked

This question tests the ability to design a real-world, multi-tenant security model across AWS accounts, with emphasis on rapid breach containment, immutable auditing, and data isolation using advanced AWS features.

## Key Concepts

- ABAC with aws:PrincipalTag for cross-account, attribute-driven access control
- RAM data sharing with strict share constraints to prevent data exfiltration
- Lake Formation per-tenant table isolation and access enforcement
- Per-tenant KMS keys with automatic rotation for encryption key management
- Immutable audit trails via CloudTrail and AWS Config
- Event-driven breach containment using EventBridge and Step Functions

## Code Example

```json
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Principal": {
        "AWS": "arn:aws:iam::${TenantAccountId}:root"
      },
      "Action": [
        "sts:AssumeRole"
      ],
      "Condition": {
        "StringEquals": {
          "aws:PrincipalTag/tenant-id": "${TenantId}",
          "aws:RequestedRegion": ["us-east-1", "us-west-2"]
        },
        "Bool": {
          "aws:SecureTransport": "true"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to implement tenant isolation with least privilege, plus rapid containment using AWS-native controls. It also covers S3 prefix scoping, per-tenant KMS keys, CloudTrail data events, and automated revocation.

## Key Concepts
- Least privilege IAM for Lambda and prefix-scoped S3 access
- S3 bucket policies with bucket-level and object-prefix constraints
- Per-tenant KMS keys and rotation
- CloudTrail Data Events for S3 access
- EventBridge-based containment workflow (60s)

## Code Example
```javascript
// IAM policy snippet for Lambda role
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": ["s3:GetObject","s3:ListBucket"],
      "Resource": [
        "arn:aws:s3:::data-lake",
        "arn:aws:s3:::data-lake/tenant-id-${aws:PrincipalTag tenantId}/*"
      ],
      "Condition": {
        "StringLike": {"s3:prefix": "tenant-id-*"}
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

